✅ 1. Where to put the trailing backslash fix

Put this IMMEDIATELY AFTER you read B8
👉 inside UpdateSupplierEvaluationSummary

🔧 BEFORE

evalFolder = Trim(ThisWorkbook.Sheets("Sheet1").Range("B8").Value)

✅ AFTER (paste this right below it)

evalFolder = Trim(ThisWorkbook.Sheets("Sheet1").Range("B8").Value)
