✅ 2. Where to split evalfile into two variables

This is important and must be done near the top of the macro.

🔧 ADD THESE DECLARATIONS (top of the sub)

Dim summaryFile As String
Dim evalFileName As String

🔧 REPLACE this line:

evalfile = Trim(ThisWorkbook.Sheets("Sheet1").Range("B5").Value)

✅ WITH:

summaryFile = Trim(ThisWorkbook.Sheets("Sheet1").Range("B5").Value)

🔧 REPLACE:

Set summaryWB = Workbooks.Open(evalfile)

✅ WITH:

Set summaryWB = Workbooks.Open(summaryFile)


