✅ 3. Where to update the file loop (For Each file)

Inside this block:

🔧 BEFORE

evalfile = file.Name
supplierCode = Trim(Left(evalfile, 6))

✅ AFTER

evalFileName = file.Name
supplierCode = Trim(Left(evalFileName, 6))


